24:["$","article",null,{"className":"space-y-12","children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"space-y-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight pt-4 border-t border-white/5","children":"1. The Business Case: Why Moving Beyond Browser Tabs Matters"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-4 text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"Modern analytics consistently reveal that mobile applications achieve 3x to 5x higher user retention, 2.5x longer average session durations, and up to 30% higher checkout conversion rates compared to responsive mobile websites."}],["$","p","1",{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"While a responsive web portal is essential for top-of-funnel search discovery and frictionless onboarding, the mobile app creates an enduring relationship. It resides permanently on the user's home screen, delivers timely push notifications, enables instantaneous biometric logins (FaceID/TouchID), and functions even when network connectivity drops in transit."}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-3 bg-[#0c162e]/70 border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 my-4","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300","children":[["$","$L1f",null,{"icon":{"name":"circle-check","size":24,"node":[["circle",{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10","key":"1mglay"}],["path",{"d":"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12","key":"xofnsj"}]],"aliases":["check-circle-2"]},"className":"w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400 mt-1 flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Zero-Latency Re-engagement: Direct push notifications reach users without relying on email open rates."}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300","children":[["$","$L1f",null,{"icon":"$24:props:children:0:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:icon","className":"w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400 mt-1 flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Hardware Integration: Access to camera scanners, BLE printers, GPS tracking, and secure enclaves."}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-300","children":[["$","$L1f",null,{"icon":"$24:props:children:0:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:icon","className":"w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400 mt-1 flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Offline Continuity: Operational resilience for field couriers, retail staff, and warehouse managers."}]]}]]}],"$undefined","$undefined",false]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"space-y-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight pt-4 border-t border-white/5","children":"2. Evaluating the Three Migration Paths: PWA vs Hybrid vs Cross-Platform Native"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-4 text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"When converting a web property into a mobile app, selecting the correct technical architecture is the single most critical decision:"}],["$","p","1",{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"Option A: Progressive Web App (PWA). Adds a Web App Manifest and Service Workers to your web application, allowing users to 'Install' the app directly from Chrome or Safari without an app store middleman. Ideal for budget-conscious projects, but lacks background Bluetooth access and faces iOS push notification constraints."}],["$","p","2",{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"Option B: Hybrid WebView Wrapper (Capacitor / Cordova). Embeds your existing web application inside a native container with access to device plugins. Fast to deploy, but risks rejection on the Apple App Store under Guideline 4.2 ('Minimum Functionality') if it feels like a raw webpage without native micro-interactions."}],["$","p","3",{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":"Option C: Cross-Platform Native (React Native / Flutter). The gold standard for enterprise conversion. Renders native platform widgets (UIKit on iOS, Android Views on Android) while reusing backend business logic and REST/GraphQL APIs. Provides 60/120 FPS buttery-smooth scrolling and total hardware control."}]]}],"$undefined","$undefined","$L29","$L2a"]}],"$L2b","$L2c","$L2d"]}]
