 text-cyan-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1","children":["Technology"," • ","8 min read"]}],["$","h4",null,{"className":"text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-white group-hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors leading-snug","children":"Virtual Reality & 3D Web Simulation: From Spatial Computing to Enterprise Applications"}]]}]]}]]}]]}]
29:["$","div",null,{"className":"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-950/40 to-blue-950/30 border-l-4 border-cyan-400 text-sm sm:text-base text-cyan-200 my-6","children":"GonjoTech Recommendation: For customer-facing e-commerce and enterprise workflows, cross-platform native (React Native / Flutter) delivers the highest ROI, customer satisfaction, and app store compliance."}]
